# Secrets — never commit (PROJECT-CONVENTIONS §3.7 / security policy)
.env
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
**/orbix.env
**/*.local.md
# QA deploy secrets (kept locally + on the box, never committed). The committed
# templates qa.env.example / deploy.env are safe; qa.env / deploy.env.local are not.
**/qa.env
**/deploy.env.local

# Backend (Maven / Java)
backend/target/
*.class
hs_err_pid*.log

# Web (Angular / Node)
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.angular/
npm-debug.log*

# Local infra data
infra/local-data/

# IDE / OS
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
